+
+# Cancellation
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the instant `at` (ISO-8601 UTC, any valid instant) and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`, in integer euro cents.
+
+- Refund policy (from task-001): cancelling less than 24 h before the booking's start, or after it has
+  started, refunds nothing; cancelling 24 h or more before the start refunds the full booking total.
+- A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment: `book` and `availability` treat the item as free.
+- A booking can only be cancelled once; a second `cancel` throws, as does an unknown booking id or an invalid `at`.
